# The calendar: deadlines on the month grid, the day's quests and a note per day.
Output docs/images/calendar.gif
Set Height 760
Source docs/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "/tmp/qt-seed /tmp/qt-vhs full >/dev/null; clear; ./quest" Enter
Sleep 4.2s
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "w"
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 900ms
Right
Sleep 900ms
Right
Sleep 1.6s
Down
Sleep 900ms
Right
Sleep 900ms
Right
Sleep 1.6s
Type "]"
Sleep 1.4s
Type "["
Sleep 900ms
Type "."
Sleep 1.4s
Tab
Sleep 900ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Right
Sleep 800ms
Type "o"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "Pack the **swimsuit** for the pool"
Sleep 1.4s
Ctrl+Q
Sleep 2.4s
